        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST**\r\n\r\n*** 3 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM HOUSE *** FULLY FURNISHED THROUGHOUT *** LARGE REAR GARDENS *** SUPER LOCATION *** AVAILABLE NOW!!\r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS proudly present this three bedroom semidetached property to the market in the highly sought-after development of Church Road, located in the heart of Rathcoole Village. With every imaginable amenity on your doorstep the location is truly next to none. Within a stone's throw you will find local bars, shops, schools, Avoca and Rathcoole Park along with a host of bus routes, the N7 & M50 road networks.\r\nBright and Spacious living accommodation comprises of; entrance hallway, lounge, dining area, fully fitted kitchen, 3 bedrooms (2 Double & 1 Single) and main bathroom. This one comes to the market in excellent condition throughout. There are a host of Public Transport links close by that will bring you in and out of the City Centre. AVAILABLE NOW, and viewing highly advised.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\nFully furnished\r\nImmaculately presented throughout\r\nLarge light filled living areas\r\nLarge bedrooms with fitted wardrobes\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nOff Street parking to the front\r\nLocated in the heart of Rathcoole Village\r\nEvery conceivable amenity within walking distance\r\nM50 & N7 within two minutes' drive\r\nAVAILABLE NOW!!\r\n\r\n** RAY COOKE LETTINGS - EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE- FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE - WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE **"
